    feat(recently-viewed): wire the rail to real Einstein recommendations

    Replaces the interim browser-tracked mechanism with useEinstein()'s
    real getRecommendations flow, matching the exact pattern the other
    four recommenders sharing this file already use. Empty state now
    gates on recommendations.recs.length directly; the local-tracking
    imports, calls, and destructures are removed entirely.

