    ~/Dev/zimmerMANN-skills/.runs/SFCC-83+84-einstein/). Loop: implementer,
    tester, orchestrator, scorer all ran. Scorer verdict: PASS, round 1.
    Visual checkpoint: not owed -- Einstein is undeployed everywhere
    reachable, so no live/visual verification is possible for this change,
    per the plan's own stated ceiling. Gates: tsc clean; test 1324/1324
    (baseline unchanged); lint 8 errors/44 warnings (identical to
    baseline, zero new); audit:tokens 3 unacknowledged (identical to
    baseline, zero new).

